00:57:47.670 --> 00:57:49.250
Get your face down in that pie.

00:57:52.690 --> 00:57:53.350
This ain't at home.

00:57:53.450 --> 00:57:55.230
This is MTV, Sunday Night Heat.

00:57:55.290 --> 00:57:56.030
Eat that pie.

00:57:57.600 --> 00:57:59.120
My little man here eating the pie.

00:58:01.210 --> 00:58:02.630
Got to use more tongue, honey.

00:58:04.040 --> 00:58:07.200
You too, Karen, use that tongue.

00:58:07.300 --> 00:58:08.020
Eat that pie.

00:58:11.350 --> 00:58:12.390
Dash, eat that pie.

00:58:12.700 --> 00:58:13.340
Good pie.

00:58:20.210 --> 00:58:23.590
All right, our test is over.

00:58:26.930 --> 00:58:28.010
I think we have a winner.

00:58:31.470 --> 00:58:36.880
I think we have a winner who's going to Raw tomorrow night at the Continental Airlines Arena.

00:58:42.800 --> 00:58:43.960
Well, The Rock says this.

00:58:45.480 --> 00:58:47.880
Anybody who eats pie with The Rock is a friend of The Rock,

00:58:47.940 --> 00:58:50.920
so The Rock says everybody's going to the show tomorrow night.

00:58:57.660 --> 00:58:59.120
Now, The Rock just has one concern.

00:58:59.300 --> 00:58:59.640
Taz.

00:59:00.160 --> 00:59:01.000
You ate your pie.

00:59:01.600 --> 00:59:03.850
Michael Cole, you didn't eat your pie.

00:59:04.470 --> 00:59:04.990
What's up?

00:59:07.060 --> 00:59:08.260
No, no, no, no, no, no, no.

00:59:08.560 --> 00:59:09.120
Shut your mouth.

00:59:09.340 --> 00:59:10.000
You didn't eat the pie.

00:59:10.350 --> 00:59:11.350
Why didn't you eat the pie?

00:59:12.420 --> 00:59:16.190
I didn't eat the pie because I had a bad experience with pie one time.

00:59:18.060 --> 00:59:19.540
You had a bad experience with pie.

00:59:21.700 --> 00:59:23.490
Was it too tart?

00:59:24.570 --> 00:59:25.210
Not really.

00:59:25.890 --> 00:59:26.350
Too sweet?

00:59:27.380 --> 00:59:27.700
No.

00:59:28.730 --> 00:59:29.610
Well, The Rock says this.

00:59:30.000 --> 00:59:31.220
Oh, you like that moon pie?

00:59:33.120 --> 00:59:33.960
No, no, no, no, no.

00:59:34.380 --> 00:59:36.370
Rock, I work with this guy week by week.

00:59:36.490 --> 00:59:38.570
I guarantee you he's a moon pie guy.

00:59:39.580 --> 00:59:40.820
Well, The Rock says this.

00:59:41.420 --> 00:59:43.480
The Rock has always said, when you're ready for pie,

00:59:44.680 --> 00:59:46.380
pie will be ready for you.

00:59:48.040 --> 00:59:52.220
If you smash what The Rock cooked in.

00:59:54.520 --> 00:59:57.260
Sports Central East with Jody Vance, your team.

01:00:01.020 --> 01:00:03.560
and the Bruins battle Dominic Hasek and the Sabres.

01:00:04.316 --> 01:00:05.076
Tuesday at 7.
